<title>USA: Sherwood Group Inc Q3 loss includes charge.</title>
<headline>Sherwood Group Inc Q3 loss includes charge.</headline>
<dateline>JERSEY CITY, N.J. 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended Feb 28.</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.02   profit	 $0.39</p>
<p> Net loss		     242   profit	 5,141</p>
<p> Revs			52,026		   47,170</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  12,884		   13,227</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.47   profit	 $0.97</p>
<p> Net profit		 6,056   profit	12,782</p>
<p> Revs		     136,086		  122,023</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  12,988		   13,239</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q3 and nine month period includes a charge of $9.19 million from settlement and fees over litigation.</p>
<p>Without the charges, the company would have reported net income of $4.3 million in Q3 and $10.6 million in the nine month period.</p>
